ration readiness and correctness, not just absent feature categories. Source findings include a usage-event feedback path (`hub.rs` and billing `auditor.rs`), a global-cost organization summary, post-spend rather than reserving budget behavior, incomplete customer connection handling and hardcoded proposal/payment output. Rich provider usage records also exist and should be reused rather than replaced.

The original audit found the desktop shell consuming exported `next_out` assets. The subsequent native migration now documents fresh Next standalone assets and a pinned Node runtime packaged through Tauri. Use [the current build contract](docs/development/native-build.md) and [remediation ledger](docs/research/native_migration_and_remediation.md) for current implementation and verification status; do not turn an earlier source finding into a claim that a defect remains unfixed. Trace actu